% a) A picker never attempts to pick up an item from an empty slot.

% b) For every slot s, a pickerCollectItem(s) never happens before the first
%    pickerStoreItem(s), and two pickerCollectItem(s) never happen without a
%    pickerStoreItem(s) in between.

% c)
forall s: SlotId .
     [ (!pickerStoreItem(toFloor(s), s))* . pickerCollectItem(toFloor(s), s) ] false
  && [ true* . pickerCollectItem(toFloor(s), s) . (!pickerStoreItem(toFloor(s), s))* . pickerCollectItem(toFloor(s), s) ] false
